  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, add the water (for the rice), then bring to the boil.\n• Add basmati rice and a pinch of salt. Stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove pan from heat. Keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340141a756d38d6af3071e/step-0a43b600.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice brown onion.\n• Grate carrot. Finely chop garlic.\n• Trim green beans and slice into thirds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340141a756d38d6af3071e/step-e8f87810.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion and carrot with a pinch of salt, tossing, until softened, 3-5 minutes. Transfer to a plate.\n• Return frying pan to high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. When oil is hot, cook green beans and veggie mince, breaking beef up mince with a spoon, until browned, 4-5 minutes. TIP: Drain the oil from the pan at the end of this step for the best results!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340141a756d38d6af3071e/step-ccedfb20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce heat to medium-high, then stir in the butter, ras el hanout, the honey, currants, tomato paste and garlic. Cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add vegetable stock powder and the water (for the beef). Bring to a simmer and cook until slightly thickened, 3-4 minutes. Season to taste. TIP: Add a splash more water to loosen the sauce, if needed!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340141a756d38d6af3071e/step-9f7cad30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the sauce is simmering, stir carrot, onion and baby spinach leaves through the rice.\n• Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340141a756d38d6af3071e/step-fafd3740.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide pilaf rice between bowls. Top with Moroccan-spiced beef.\n• Serve with Greek-style yoghurt. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340141a756d38d6af3071e/step-b8e78450.jpg"
    }
  ]
